Read `docs/architecture.md` before adding components, APIs, or workflow states.

DevFlow is the control plane. DeepSeek Harness owns the model/tool loop. Qwen
stays on the Mac. Do not reimplement the harness inside this repo.

If an implementation would disagree with the spec, stop and add an ADR under
`docs/adrs/` instead of rewriting `docs/architecture.md` to match the code.
